#: data/maps/FallarborTown_MoveRelearnersHouse/scripts.inc:60
msgctxt "FallarborTown_MoveRelearnersHouse_Text_ImTheMoveTutor"
msgid ""
"I'm the MOVE TUTOR.\p"
"I know all the moves that POKéMON\n"
"learn--every one of them--and I can\l"
"teach POKéMON those moves.\p"
"I can teach a move to a POKéMON\n"
"of yours if you'd like.\p"
"I'll do it for a HEART SCALE.\n"
"I'm collecting those now.$"
msgstr ""
"我是招式教学人。\p"
"宝可梦能学会的招式，我全部——每一个\n"
"都知道，而且能教宝可梦学会那些招式。\p"
"如果你愿意的话，\n"
"我可以教你的宝可梦一个招式。\p"
"只要给我一枚心之鳞片就行。\n"
"我现在正在收集它。$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_MoveRelearnersHouse/scripts.inc:70
msgctxt "FallarborTown_MoveRelearnersHouse_Text_ThatsAHeartScaleWantMeToTeachMove"
msgid ""
"Oh! That's it! That's an honest to\n"
"goodness HEART SCALE!\p"
"Let me guess, you want me to teach\n"
"a move?$"
msgstr ""
"哦！就是它！这是货真价实的心之鳞片！\p"
"让我猜猜，你是想让我教招式吧？$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_MoveRelearnersHouse/scripts.inc:76
msgctxt "FallarborTown_MoveRelearnersHouse_Text_TutorWhichMon"
msgid "Which POKéMON needs tutoring?$"
msgstr "要教哪只宝可梦呢？$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_MoveRelearnersHouse/scripts.inc:79
msgctxt "FallarborTown_MoveRelearnersHouse_Text_TeachWhichMove"
msgid "Which move should I teach?$"
msgstr "要教哪个招式呢？$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_MoveRelearnersHouse/scripts.inc:82
msgctxt "FallarborTown_MoveRelearnersHouse_Text_DontHaveMoveToTeachPokemon"
msgid ""
"Sorry…\p"
"It doesn't appear as if I have any move\n"
"I can teach that POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"抱歉……\p"
"我好像没有能教给那只宝可梦的招式。$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_MoveRelearnersHouse/scripts.inc:87
msgctxt "FallarborTown_MoveRelearnersHouse_Text_HandedOverHeartScale"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} handed over one HEART SCALE\n"
"in exchange.$"
msgstr "{PLAYER}交出了1枚心之鳞片作为交换。$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_MoveRelearnersHouse/scripts.inc:91
msgctxt "FallarborTown_MoveRelearnersHouse_Text_ComeBackWithHeartScale"
msgid ""
"If your POKéMON need to learn a move,\n"
"come back with a HEART SCALE.$"
msgstr ""
"如果你的宝可梦需要学习招式，\n"
"就带着心之鳞片再来吧。$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_MoveRelearnersHouse/scripts.inc:95
msgctxt "FallarborTown_MoveRelearnersHouse_Text_CantTeachEgg"
msgid ""
"Hunh? There isn't a single move that\n"
"I can teach an EGG.$"
msgstr "嗯？我可没有能教给蛋的招式。$"
